  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you change the lens visibility while the lens is stuck on the \"tablet\" you will change the visibility for both when it's attached and when it's not attached (local / world). But if you change the visibility when it's not stuck to the tablet (local / world) you will only change it for those modes. As soon as you change it back to being stuck on the tablet (default) the Lens will be invisible again.\nThis feels really weird and is kinda confusing, my suggestion would be to always make the lens invisible in default mode (when being attached to the tablet) and only changing the viability when it's not attached.\nAnd if people still want to see where the middle is on the tablet when the lens is attached, you could add a little dot to the middle (like the desktop reticle).",
